# Quick syntax showcase #quick-syntax

NODX keeps common authoring tasks compact:
**strong**, *emphasis*, ~~deleted text~~,
==highlight with theme override=={bg="#ffe08a" color="#111827"},
H~2~O, and x^2^.

[[Approved]].status.success and [[Needs review]]{bg="#fff7ed" color="#9a3412" pad="0.1em 0.35em" radius="999px"}
are inline spans without a style block.

::::page {bg="#f8fafc" color="#111827" pad="1.25rem" radius="10px"}
## Page-like section #page-like

This region uses `:::page` plus quick attributes. It can have a local
background color, text color, spacing, border, and background image when the
asset is packaged.

:::grid {columns="repeat(3,1fr)" gap="1rem"}
::frame {bg="#ffffff" border="1px solid #d1d5db" pad="1rem" radius="8px"}
### Frame A

Compact frame syntax.
::

::frame {bg="#ecfeff" border="1px solid #67e8f9" pad="1rem" radius="8px"}
### Frame B

Uses `bg`, `border`, `pad`, and `radius`.
::

::frame {bg="#fef3c7" border="1px solid #fbbf24" pad="1rem" radius="8px"}
### Frame C

No `::style` needed.
::
:::

