## Pipe-table cell attributes #pipe-table-attrs

| Item | Amount |
| :--- | ---: |
| Alpha | 40K |
| Beta | 80K |
| {colspan=2 align="center" bg="#dcfce7"} Total: 120K |

Use `::style` only when a rule needs to be shared across many nodes,
targets media queries, or belongs to a reusable theme.

## Quote alias #quote-alias

> Compact quote syntax parses as the same node as `::quote`.
>
> - quoted lists stay structured
